WEBVTT

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.140
Look!

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:41.980
It's the teacher who arrived here last week.

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:44.040
Ms. Mine Fujiko!

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:46.860
Ms. Fujiko!

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:48.900
What is it?

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:53.050
Um, there was something I didn't understand in yesterday's class.

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:56.510
Angelica's such a bitch!

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:58.500
She's bothering the teacher!

00:01:58.500 --> 00:01:59.420
Right?

00:02:05.770 --> 00:02:10.470
"Women never show themselves in their natural form.”

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:16.620
"That is to say, they are not so vain as men, who conceive themselves

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:21.330
to be always amiable enough,
just as nature has produced them.”

00:02:21.980 --> 00:02:24.030
She's wonderful!

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:27.460
When Goethe's words flow from her lips,

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:29.560
they sound like music from heaven!

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:47.710
That's all for today.

00:02:49.590 --> 00:02:54.360
If you have any questions, come see me.

00:02:56.260 --> 00:02:58.880
You are a scary person.

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:05.650
The moment our gazes met, my heart has been in handcuffs I cannot escape from.

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:08.410
I am a sinner of love.

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:11.650
I'm sure you will never choose me.

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:14.450
Even so, I don't care.

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:17.120
Inside this prison of love...

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:22.600
Ms. Fujiko,

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:25.710
I'm in love with—

00:03:25.710 --> 00:03:28.430
This is an enclosed garden.

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:30.460
If you flutter your wings in the outside world,

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:35.970
you will find out that your feelings for me are just vagaries of youth.

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:40.000
I don't want to find out!

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:43.970
I want to... stay here with you forever!

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:11.120
I-I have to go!

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:22.120
Isolde Brach, right? Is something wrong?

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:26.540
Do you have a question about today's class?

00:04:28.070 --> 00:04:29.860
Or...

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:36.320
...a question about kissing technique?

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:48.290
I'm sorry.

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:53.050
You're cute.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:11.210
It was like a dream.

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:16.080
Was it just a happy dream?

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:19.070
Or...

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:24.560
a nightmare?

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:31.600
Isolde, that's a lovely pendant.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:33.760
It's a memento of my father's.

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:35.870
I'm sorry.

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:38.180
I brought up something painful for you.

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:42.600
No, it's fine. My father was a famous scholar.

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:45.600
And then last month, he suddenly...

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:48.820
He was a very kind man.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:57.030
Up until now, I've stayed home with him instead of going to school.

00:05:57.570 --> 00:06:00.350
We did everything together.

00:06:02.230 --> 00:06:05.330
Did your father have black hair?

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:10.280
I was just thinking that your black hair is really pretty.

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:14.920
I've thought so since I first saw you.

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:30.020
What do you think you're doing?

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:34.760
Monopolizing Ms. Fujiko, even though you're just a transfer student?

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:35.730
I didn't...

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:39.610
You deserve to be punished for this.

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:44.660
Serves you right!

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:49.170
Too bad it's the black hair that she just complimented.

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:52.750
If you're going to ogle the teacher,

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:56.110
let's make sure everyone knows.

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:12.020
Babysitting kids really is tough.

00:07:12.020 --> 00:07:16.480
I've had enough fun playing
the part of a beloved teacher.

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:19.690
It's time to wrap things up.

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:23.870
Yes?

00:07:25.890 --> 00:07:28.480
Isolde, you look...

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:30.620
Ms. Fujiko!

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:35.120
Isolde...

00:07:37.170 --> 00:07:41.020
Teach me. Please teach me.

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:42.190
What?

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:48.600
Kissing technique.

00:07:55.560 --> 00:07:57.360
Bad girl.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:06.110
Tastes like alcohol...

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:07.150
No.

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:13.090
I want to know more about you, Ms. Fujiko.

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:22.920
"Women never show themselves in their natural form.”

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:31.140
“That is to say, they are not so vain as men,

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:34.020
who conceive themselves to be always amiable enough,

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:37.520
just as nature has produced them.”

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:44.530
Aren't you quite vain yourself, Ms. Fujiko?

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:58.000
To think that all the girls are so attached to you...

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:00.670
Even though you're just a spittoon.

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.670
Mine Fujiko.

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:07.180
You've really done it now.

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:11.940
Brach, a physicist, never announced this theory.

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:14.680
It remained hidden until his death.

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:19.230
The academic world would go into an uproar if it were published.

00:09:19.230 --> 00:09:21.840
It could be sold for a pretty good price.

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:24.210
Brach's thesis has two parts.

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:27.850
By themselves, they're only
indecipherable pieces of a puzzle.

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:32.990
They only have any meaning when they're together.

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:37.280
Fujiko must be trying to steal the other one.

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:39.220
Oscar.

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:41.210
Leave it to me, Inspector.

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:43.250
Excuse me.

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:45.510
Inspector, read this.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:53.470
"I'm going to steal both parts
of Brach's lost thesis." - Lupin III

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:55.990
Lupin! Then I'll go myself—

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:58.250
Leave it to me, Inspector.

00:09:58.940 --> 00:10:01.060
I'll be the one...

00:10:02.470 --> 00:10:06.820
to not only catch Fujiko, but Lupin as well.

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:09.820
Isolde, what's that outfit for?

00:10:09.820 --> 00:10:15.930
R-Right. From now on,
I'll be attending an all-girls school.

00:10:15.930 --> 00:10:17.250
And so...

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:18.440
Strip.

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:19.250
Huh?

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:27.590
If you want to protect the memento of your father...

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:30.740
then strip.

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:46.330
Not as vain as men, huh?

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:52.970
Mine Fujiko... He made love to you, to this body.

00:10:57.120 --> 00:10:59.530
You are someone to be feared.

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:08.170
The moment our gazes met, my heart has been in handcuffs I cannot escape from.

00:11:10.280 --> 00:11:14.640
In front of you, I am a sinner of love.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:18.400
I'm sure you will never choose me.

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:21.140
Even so, I don't care.

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:25.650
Inside this prison of love...

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:30.610
I'll continue screaming my love for you.

00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:39.580
Inspector Zenigata,
I will use this ugly bait to catch Lupin,

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:42.580
and then I will offer him to you.

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:00.800
That brat...

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:17.820
Ms. Fujiko still isn't here?

00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:20.240
Maybe she's sick.

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:22.870
I wonder if she's okay?

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:30.480
Hurry up and retrieve Mine Fujiko.

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:31.460
Yeah.

00:13:31.460 --> 00:13:32.920
The thesis is safe.

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:35.960
All that's left is for <i>him</i> to show up.

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:46.680
<i>I feel it, Lupin.</i>

00:13:47.210 --> 00:13:50.700
<i>It's fixed on the tight, smooth,</i>

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:54.190
<i>brilliant whiteness of these thin boots.</i>

00:13:55.340 --> 00:13:57.720
<i>Your passionate gaze, that is.</i>

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:04.450
<i>If I walk down this rarely used path, then you'll...</i>

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:07.860
Don't be afraid.

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:10.700
There'll be no problems. You see...

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:13.220
I'm a proper gentleman.

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:16.710
<i>I've got you.</i>

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:21.220
Ms. Fujiko was after my pendant?

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:25.980
I don't believe it. She already stole it from me.

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:26.970
Huh?

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:28.470
What's that on your chest, then?

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:33.850
Ms. Fujiko stole something important from me.

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:38.730
Oh dear, would you say that it was your heart?

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:42.980
Something more important... than my heart.

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:45.360
Oh, okay!

00:14:46.390 --> 00:14:49.120
I won't let her steal anything
else that's precious to you.

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:52.290
I'll protect you, Isolde.

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:54.680
Really? You will?

00:14:54.680 --> 00:14:57.790
Sure! Leave it all to me!

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:58.900
I'm so happy!

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:10.010
This is a paradise for us maidens.

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:12.980
Any cockroach men who intrude...

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:17.150
will be exterminated immediately!

00:15:18.190 --> 00:15:19.400
Hey, wait a minute!

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:21.190
Mister, let's escape!

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:39.130
Mister, over there!

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:45.210
This is like another world.

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:48.110
To whisper of your love in here...

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:50.680
wouldn't be too bad.

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:56.250
Hey!

00:15:56.250 --> 00:15:57.470
Isolde?

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:24.340
Isolde.

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:29.390
Well done. Thanks, girls.

00:16:29.390 --> 00:16:32.090
No, it was nothing.

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:37.220
We stole something important from you, after all.

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:41.860
You've done enough now.
Why don't you go back to class?

00:16:43.150 --> 00:16:44.680
Get back already!

00:16:45.800 --> 00:16:48.070
Y-Yes!

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:56.330
Yeah.

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:57.580
<i>It's Zenigata.</i>

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:01.790
Inspector! I captured Lupin—

00:17:02.650 --> 00:17:04.800
<i>What... are you doing?</i>

00:17:06.910 --> 00:17:09.250
Inspector! What's wrong?

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:10.490
Inspector!

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:18.770
<i>Wasn't it nice to hear his voice?</i>

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:21.430
Mine Fujiko.

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:23.490
You got away?

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:24.990
You vulgar thief.

00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:29.440
<i>Yes. Thanks to you, my theft was a big success.</i>

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:32.050
This is...

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:38.910
<i>It's a technique every vulgar thief like me knows.</i>

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:43.170
<i>A very, very basic little trick.</i>

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:47.310
<i>Maybe you felt it but didn't realize it?</i>

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:55.390
Simply having the pendant
doesn't mean you'll get the thesis.

00:17:55.390 --> 00:17:57.330
<i>Da Vinci Code.</i>

00:17:57.330 --> 00:18:00.660
This pendant is new.

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:04.850
You replaced it with one that serves as a hiding place for the thesis.

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:07.290
<i>It has a combination lock on it.</i>

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:11.540
<i>If you enter the wrong number...</i>

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:15.250
<i>it gets the iron maiden treatment,</i>

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:17.560
<i>and you can say goodbye to the thesis.</i>

00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:19.380
<i>That's pretty complex.</i>

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:22.970
<i>I thought you were just an immature brat.</i>

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:26.100
I can't say I'm glad to be praised by a thief.

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:29.600
<i>Oh, you dislike being praised? In that case...</i>

00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:32.590
I'll bully you.

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:39.600
What did you do to Inspector Zenigata?!

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:45.680
<i>You see, I'm actually better at torture than stealing.</i>

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:46.640
Torture?

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:49.680
<i>Next is his thumbnail.</i>

00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:50.450
What?

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:52.940
<i>I'll... I'll die!</i>

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:58.190
<i>Will you tell me the code before he loses all of them?</i>

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:03.010
Inspector Zenigata!

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:07.710
Okay, I'll tell you! Just stop it!

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:10.180
Don't touch him anymore!

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:11.580
The code...

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:17.710
Inspector!

00:19:18.570 --> 00:19:19.970
I'm so glad!

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:23.840
Inspector Zenigata, you're okay now, right?

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:27.090
What are you talking about?

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:32.100
She couldn't have...

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:33.940
Excuse me!

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:35.850
Hey, Oscar!

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:03.050
You're so kind to have saved me like that, Lupin.

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:07.600
I'm not good at detailed work like decrypting codes.

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:12.160
I only joined since you said you'd take on that part. But don't forget—

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:14.550
I know.

00:20:14.550 --> 00:20:16.940
You'll get your share.

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:18.850
Oh, I've got it!

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:22.470
By the way, how did you trick that kid?

00:20:23.930 --> 00:20:26.070
What are you doing?

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:29.080
Oh, we're finally together again.

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:31.580
Let's just forget about everything and enjoy ourselves.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:37.000
Well, er, I mean, you can't do it <i>there </i>like <i>that</i>!

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.980
Leave it to a cat burglar...

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:44.590
I'll die! I'll die if you do any more!

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.840
So you recorded that?

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:53.960
Both despair and ecstasy are part of the elements that compose a person.

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:55.550
Or something like that.

00:20:59.050 --> 00:21:02.900
Z, N, G, T.

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:07.060
Ze-ni-ga-ta!

00:21:07.850 --> 00:21:09.200
Enough, leave.

00:21:14.820 --> 00:21:16.650
<i>I won't forgive her.</i>

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:21.670
<i>That spittoon who peeps at and treads on my feelings! </i>

00:21:23.460 --> 00:21:27.970
<i>Mine Fujiko, I'll get you! </i>
